# Platform Checklist: {{ project_name }}

Use this checklist to manually verify the migration on the target platform.

## Build Verification

### Compilation
- [ ] Project compiles without errors on {{ target_platform }}
- [ ] No compiler warnings related to platform-specific code
- [ ] All dependencies are resolved
- [ ] Build system correctly detects {{ target_platform }}

### Linking
- [ ] All libraries are available on {{ target_platform }}
- [ ] No undefined symbol errors
- [ ] No missing framework errors

### Packaging
- [ ] Application can be installed on {{ target_platform }}
- [ ] Desktop shortcut/start menu entry created (if applicable)
- [ ] File associations work (if applicable)

## Runtime Verification

### Application Launch
- [ ] Application starts without errors
- [ ] Main window appears (if GUI app)
- [ ] No crash on startup
- [ ] Configuration files are loaded correctly
- [ ] Command-line arguments are parsed correctly

### Core Functionality
- [ ] Basic operations work as expected
- [ ] File open/save works with {{ target_platform }} paths
- [ ] File dialogs show correct directories
- [ ] Clipboard operations work
- [ ] Drag and drop works (if applicable)

### Platform Integration
- [ ] System tray / dock icon appears (if applicable)
- [ ] Notifications work (if applicable)
- [ ] Keyboard shortcuts work correctly
- [ ] HiDPI scaling is correct
- [ ] Multiple monitor support works

### Performance
- [ ] Application responds within acceptable time
- [ ] No memory leaks (run for extended period)
- [ ] GPU usage is reasonable (if applicable)
- [ ] CPU usage is reasonable

## Platform-Specific Checks

{% if target_platform == "linux" %}
### Linux-Specific
- [ ] Works on both X11 and Wayland
- [ ] Follows XDG directory specification
- [ ] `.desktop` file is valid
- [ ] Icon installed in hicolor theme
- [ ] AppStream metadata is correct (if applicable)
- [ ] File permissions are correct (executable bit set)
{% elif target_platform == "macos" %}
### macOS-Specific
- [ ] App bundle structure is correct
- [ ] `Info.plist` is valid
- [ ] Code signing works
- [ ] Notarization passes (if distributing)
- [ ] Universal binary (ARM + x86) if needed
{% elif target_platform == "windows" %}
### Windows-Specific
- [ ] No hardcoded Unix paths
- [ ] Registry entries created correctly (if needed)
- [ ] MSI or exe installer works
- [ ] Uninstaller removes all files
- [ ] UAC elevation works correctly (if needed)
{% endif %}

